    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tophet</strong> \u2013 A 4-Player Co-op Horror Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One ordinary night at the foster home, you and the other foster children are woken by a terrifying scream from downstairs. As you step into the darkness, the once-familiar home twists into something sinister. <strong>What\u2019s lurking in the shadows? What happened to your foster parents?</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280430/extras/84b1404dd322d2f6d6128da81c723cda.poster.avif?t=1741053545\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280430/extras/84b1404dd322d2f6d6128da81c723cda.webm?t=1741053545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280430/extras/84b1404dd322d2f6d6128da81c723cda.mp4?t=1741053545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the Horror Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tophet is an <strong>immersive multiplayer survival horror game</strong> where you and your friends must <strong>work together to uncover the chilling mystery of the cursed foster farmhouse.</strong> Gather items, solve puzzles, and <strong>evade relentless horrors</strong> in a desperate fight for survival. <strong>Can you unravel the house\u2019s dark past... or will it claim you, too?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280430/extras/4cb247b6eaaa887e73ad76b2fedc6786.poster.avif?t=1741053545\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280430/extras/4cb247b6eaaa887e73ad76b2fedc6786.webm?t=1741053545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280430/extras/4cb247b6eaaa887e73ad76b2fedc6786.mp4?t=1741053545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Player Co-Op</strong>: Team up with up to 4 players for a truly immersive co-op horror experience. Trust your friends, or face the terror alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Monsters &amp; Curses</strong>: Encounter dynamic enemies and supernatural curses that react to your every move, ensuring no two playthroughs are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Investigation</strong>: Explore a chilling environment as you uncover the truth behind the evil forces that haunt the foster home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unreal Engine 5 Powered</strong>: Experience stunning graphics and terrifying atmospheric details brought to life by the power of Unreal Engine 5.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Developed</strong>: A uniquely terrifying experience, handcrafted by a passionate solo developer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280430/extras/b739253311976fe1914f053e2b947cfe.poster.avif?t=1741053545\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280430/extras/b739253311976fe1914f053e2b947cfe.webm?t=1741053545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280430/extras/b739253311976fe1914f053e2b947cfe.mp4?t=1741053545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Horror Awaits\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your friends, prepare for the worst, and face the unimaginable horrors lurking within. <strong>The truth of what happened to your foster parents is just the beginning. Will you survive the night?</strong><br><br><u>Mature Content Description</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content</i></p>",
