s=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your friends, prepare for the worst, and face the unimaginable horrors lurking within. <strong>The truth of what happened to your foster parents is just the beginning. Will you survive the night?</strong><br><br><u>Mature Content Description</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content</i></p>",
